6003-26-000074","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-07-30","reportDate":"2026-06-30","cik":"0001166003","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1166003/000116600326000074/xpo-20260630.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/44048dc885dbc586046a68362a47bf3b90c3ec6697fdb2849080034d52b5ec5a.bin","sha256":"44048dc885dbc586046a68362a47bf3b90c3ec6697fdb2849080034d52b5ec5a"}},{"id":"e9fe9653819626b13c1fcc841d2e925bad1279f683e5300288fb0caaa9bb1da8","quote":"Revenue in our European Transportation segment increased 10.2% to $927 million for the second quarter of 2026, compared with $841 million for the same quarter in 2025. Revenue increased 10.6% to $1.8 billion for the first six months of 2026, compared with $1.6 billion for the same period in 2025. Foreign currency movement increased revenue by approximately 2.4 percentage points in the second quarter of 2026 and by approximately 6.4 percentage points in the first six months of 2026. The increase in revenue reflects improved pricing, the impact of foreign currency movements and higher fuel revenue.","context":"(1) Percent of Revenue is calculated using the underlying unrounded amounts.","section":"Item 2. Management’s Discussion and Analysis of Financial Condition and Results of Operations.","block":304,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001166003-26-000074","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-07-30","reportDate":"2026-06-30","cik":"0001166003","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1166003/000116600326000074/xpo-20260630.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/44048dc885dbc586046a68362a47bf3b90c3ec6697fdb2849080034d52b5ec5a.bin","sha256":"44048dc885dbc586046a68362a47bf3b90c3ec6697fdb2849080034d52b5ec5a"}},{"id":"c536b7a5f7f98409ee56e5d8e487a06aed5d8610459cc4b3237f6bf68a348d02","quote":"Adjusted EBITDA was $48 million for the second quarter of 2026, compared with $44 million for the same quarter in 2025. Adjusted EBITDA was $81 million for the first six months of 2026, compared with $76 million for the same period in 2025. The increase in adjusted EBITDA in both the second quarter and the first six months of 2026 primarily reflects higher revenue, partially offset by higher fuel costs, operating lease and facility costs, purchased transportation and salaries, wages and employee benefits.","context":"Revenue in our European Transportation segment increased 10.2% to $927 million for the second quarter of 2026, compared with $841 million for the same quarter in 2025. Revenue increased 10.6% to $1.8 billion for the first six months of 2026, compared with $1.6 billion for the same period in 2025. Foreign currency movement increased revenue by approximately 2.4 percentage points in the second quarter of 2026 and by approximately 6.4 percentage points in the first six months of 2026. The increase in revenue reflects improved pricing, the impact of foreign currency movements and higher fuel revenue.","section":"Item 2. Management’s Discussion and Analysis of Financial Condition and Results of Operations.","block":305,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001166003-26-000074","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-07-30","reportDate":"2026-06-30","cik":"0001166003","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1166003/000116600326000074/xpo-20260630.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/44048dc885dbc586046a68362a47bf3b90c3ec6697fdb2849080034d52b5ec5a.bin","sha256":"44048dc885dbc586046a68362a47bf3b90c3ec6697fdb2849080034d52b5ec5a"}}],"omittedEvidenceCount":0}},"warnings":["managementExplanations: evidence cap reached."]}